{"year":"2023","content":[{"type":"text","content_text":"La 80.ª ceremonia se realizó el 10 de enero de 2023 en el Beverly Hilton, con la conducción del comediante <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1400880, 'screen_type': person}\">Jerrod Carmichael</a> y de vuelta en NBC después de un año fuera del aire. <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 674324, 'screen_type': movie}\">The Banshees of Inisherin</a> (Los espíritus de la isla, 2022) encabezó las nominaciones (8) y ganó tres premios, entre ellos Mejor Película - Musical o Comedia, y <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 804095, 'screen_type': movie}\">The Fabelmans</a> (Los Fabelman, 2022) se llevó Drama y Dirección para <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 488, 'screen_type': person}\">Steven Spielberg</a>. Fue la última edición bajo la HFPA: en junio de 2023 la asociación fue disuelta y el Globo de Oro pasó a Dick Clark Productions y Eldridge Industries. <i>No se incluyen los premios de televisión.</i>"},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Mejor Película Dramática","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":804095,"name":"Los Fabelman","image_path":"/meqKIZTsdSlbvv47uxvJH7Jcr7H.jpg","director":"Steven Spielberg","winner":true},{"type":"movie","id":76600,"name":"Avatar: El camino del agua","image_path":"/hm6nONQOgVpKmRK5YUX9EqfJ0NH.jpg","director":"James Cameron","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":614934,"name":"Elvis","image_path":"/iekpzEjWsT7xLwm59U8ZqMIdkiM.jpg","director":"Baz Luhrmann","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":817758,"name":"TÁR","image_path":"/yWGpEgjneDeYp6zK5c7WKbEBNO1.jpg","director":"Todd Field","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":361743,"name":"Top Gun: Maverick","image_path":"/kPbuLGVSJHATkW9fX9L3h1wM0Pa.jpg","director":"Joseph Kosinski","winner":false}]},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Mejor Película Musical o de Comedia","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":674324,"name":"Los espíritus de la isla","image_path":"/rtJtaJ3ayYJ2PdwgZpEQyBETpyu.jpg","director":"Martin McDonagh","winner":true},{"type":"movie","id":615777,"name":"Babylon","image_path":"/qZUmMxJbGmkIYwnS7qRfSOREmvC.jpg","director":"Damien Chazelle","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":545611,"name":"Todo en Todas Partes al Mismo Tiempo","image_path":"/2dSZQGwijlXvMSyuGe0FSgrXnv0.jpg","director":"Daniel Scheinert, Daniel Kwan","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":661374,"name":"Glass Onion: Un misterio de Knives Out","image_path":"/zQJcENHbZUpLQ8RKYt9wTzcXCwv.jpg","director":"Rian Johnson","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":497828,"name":"El Triángulo de la Tristeza","image_path":"/scfQwUUe0MQb0T5khF1x5e4HSoR.jpg","director":"Ruben Östlund","winner":false}]},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Mejor Actriz en Película Dramática","nominee_list":[{"type":"person","id":112,"name":"Cate Blanchett","image_path":"/vUuEHiAR0eD3XEJhg2DWIjymUAA.jpg","winner":true,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":817758,"name":"TÁR","image_path":"/yWGpEgjneDeYp6zK5c7WKbEBNO1.jpg","director":"Todd Field"}},{"type":"person","id":39187,"name":"Olivia Colman","image_path":"/lawJUdbLb1YW0niaYjiVGR9IBG8.jpg","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":814757,"name":"Imperio de luz","image_path":"/9hoNGfSq3ZiolERu1yFEOWhGLPL.jpg","director":"Sam Mendes"}},{"type":"person","id":19492,"name":"Viola Davis","image_path":"/xDssw6vpYNRjsybvMPRE30e0dPN.jpg","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":724495,"name":"La Mujer Rey","image_path":"/4MjnLp48IUK0O9EtWS4TvjMtLq3.jpg","director":"Gina Prince-Bythewood"}},{"type":"person","id":224513,"name":"Ana de Armas","image_path":"/ngHnBOofQzCO3AvMyuW3UMRWg1B.jpg","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":301502,"name":"Rubia","image_path":"/9dmnwgKGkuxBgvDhOHaqlZtgrv9.jpg","director":"Andrew Dominik"}},{"type":"person","id":1812,"name":"Michelle Williams","image_path":"/jn3BVMVbIptz2gc6Fhxo1qwJVvW.jpg","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":804095,"name":"Los Fabelman","image_path":"/meqKIZTsdSlbvv47uxvJH7Jcr7H.jpg","director":"Steven Spielberg"}}]},{"type":"awar